  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/XgH4EpyPD2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1321365/description_19767e94-ef82-4569-92c6-b1e8b60e6e07.png\" alt=\"image\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>✨ 我真的很讨厌阴影……</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"><strong>i hate shadows</strong> 是一款轻量级的 Minecraft 着色器，它只做一件事——而且做得完美无缺：<br>\n它<em>彻底移除所有阴影</em>。🌞</p>\n<p>没有阴暗角落，没有诡异氛围——无论看向何处，都是纯粹明亮的日光。<br>\n非常适合喜欢极简视觉、追求性能提升以及希望世界永远光明不黑暗的玩家。<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<h3>🌟 功能特性</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>❌ 完全没有任何阴影</li>\n<li>⚡ 对帧率友好，极度轻量</li>\n<li>🌞 始终明亮，画面干净清爽</li>\n<li>🎮 在低配设备上运行流畅</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c4802293a8389a4e7c76cbe512a94a31f4b4f1ea.png\" alt=\"Mine\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fxsoras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f7d0d642a94e503b0efdbc6a69a36cbbb8b6663.png\" alt=\"Use code\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/656273342c192bb4cb8e256b79e2d466967ef86e.png\" alt=\"our partners\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7140066238c79827aee86f3902188c86e561ee1c_0.webp\" alt=\"partners\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/93821b8a371bdaef6d5d713d6aeea3f7ea2470bb_0.webp\" alt=\"splitter\"></p>\n<p